            "scene_context": "You round a bend in the luminescent path. Ahead, a clearing bathed in an almost blinding turquoise light. Dominating the space is a massive, fallen Lumiflora – its cap fractured, revealing a network of pulsing, violet veins beneath. The air hums with a low, resonant frequency. Fine, silver dust drifts from the broken mushroom, settling on your skin. A single, bioluminescent firefly circles the fallen giant, then flits away, seemingly beckoning you onward. The forest's gentle pulse momentarily falters, then recovers, a little weaker than before.",
